# 08-RemoveAndPurge.proton: Packages to remove-and-purge — Proton and related software
#
# Entries listed here are removed by `make remove-and-purge` /
# `make 08_RemoveAndPurge_proton` and are filtered out of the matching
# `Install/08-Install.proton` (and same-tier or lower-tier Install files) by the smart
# filter on `make install` — see docs/INSTALL.md.
#
# Like `Uninstall/`, but for casks the runner uses `brew uninstall --cask --zap`
# so the cask's declared user data (preferences, caches, login items) is also
# removed. Behavior for `brew '...'` formulae and `mas '...'` entries is
# identical to `Uninstall/`.
#
# Format mirrors a Brewfile: `brew '...'`, `cask '...'`, or
# `mas '...', id: NNNNN`. `tap` directives are ignored. Comments and blank
# lines are ignored.

